[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11104.15, "timestamp": "03:05:04", "text": "。  還有，你知道嗎？時間快到了。我得結束了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11105.99, "timestamp": "03:05:05", "text": "。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11124.63, "timestamp": "03:05:24", "text": "。謝謝你今天抽出時間，喬。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11146.95, "timestamp": "03:05:46", "text": "，你要好好照顧自己"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11149.349, "timestamp": "03:05:49", "text": "。好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11154.07, "timestamp": "03:05:54", "text": "。  呃，在結束通話之前，你還有什麼想說的嗎？還有什麼要補充的嗎？  你知道嗎？我確實有"}]